  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox relays what a witness told him about Varginha, a town in Brazil where people say a strange creature was captured in 1996. According to the witness, the creature was taken to a hospital and the smell it left was so strong that a whole wing had to be closed for weeks. In a later telling Fox names the hospital as the Hospital Regional and places the smell in the room where the being was X-rayed, details that would point to a real body being examined there."
